目で穏やかとできた女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"反面、裕福な両親から大切に育てられたこともあって、アルバイトを含め働いたことがなく、若干世間からずれており、いわゆる箱入り娘の気がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母性本能が強く子供好きで、将来渉との子を持ちたいと強く思っている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"146848"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e9/e929262a304c36d324c0d9eb91002ca6e3bddef6877186703b9fbd67988ed571.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7a/7aa9f071ccf5c94d2630111e4e01d16b12a396cf0ca8080008913b1cf71f197b.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"平野有紗","creatorId":"vndb:s4474","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4474","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4474","name":"平野 有紗","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:364800:146848:30292:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c107218","characterName":"飛鳥馬 聖翔","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c107218"},"originalCharacterName":"飛鳥馬 聖翔","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The grandson of the president of the company where Wataru works."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is a student and will take the entrance exam this year."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Since his parents are rarely at home, he hires a housekeeper, and the job was introduced to Rumi through the president."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is polite, calm, and a nice young man who smiles a lot for his age."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"--He is polite and calm, and acts as if he were a young man."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c107218"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b4/b4